name: sim.removeBanner
description: 
luaSynopsis: sim.removeBanner(int bannerID)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. bannerID: handle of a previously added banner. sim.handle_all removes all banners from the scene, that were created in a script (banners created from the C interface are not removed)
